eturn false;\" class=\"BVDILink BVDILinkDisabled\"> <span class=\"BVDILinkSpan\">Verified Purchaser<\/span><\/a><\/dt><dd><p>Customer has been confirmed to have purchased the item from Walmart.<\/p><\/dd><\/dl><\/div><\/div><\/div>\n<a onclick=\"return false;\" class=\"BVDILink BVDILinkDisabled\" id=\"BVDI_BABadge_pgaigxiacuueaf2ttohw2zuxf_ID\"onmouseover=\"bvTooltip.show(&quot;BVDI_BAPopup_e45143mzb2oxr0cclkkutyr3x_ID&quot;, this.id, false, []);\"onmouseout=\"bvTooltip.hide();\"> <span class=\"BVDILinkSpan\">Verified Purchaser<\/span><\/a><\/li><li class=\"BVDI_BAItem BVDI_BAItemOdd BVDI_BAItemPrizeIncentive\"><div id=\"BVDI_BAPopup_e2takl4swvkufzw4soddwcrzm_ID\" class=\"BVDIPopup BVDI_BAPopup BVDI_BAPopupPrizeIncentive\" style=\"display: none;\"><div class=\"BVDIInside BVDI_BAInsidePopup\"><div class=\"BVDIBody BVDI_BAPopupBody\"><dl class=\"BVDI_BAList\"><dt class=\"BVDI_BAItem BVDI_BAItemOnly BVDI_BAItemPrizeIncentive\">\n<a onclick=\"return false;\" class=\"BVDILink BVDILinkDisabled\"> <span class=\"BVDILinkSpan\">This review was submitted as a PrizeIncentive<\/span><\/a><\/dt><dd>This review was submitted as a PrizeIncentive<\/dd><\/dl><\/div><\/div><\/div>\n<a onclick=\"return false;\" class=\"BVDILink BVDILinkDisabled\" id=\"BVDI_BABadge_6532rucrtlysismwajvs0f1iz_ID\"onmouseover=\"bvTooltip.show(&quot;BVDI_BAPopup_e2takl4swvkufzw4soddwcrzm_ID&quot;, this.id, false, []);\"onmouseout=\"bvTooltip.hide();\"> <span class=\"BVDILinkSpan\">This review was submitted as a PrizeIncentive<\/span><\/a><\/li><\/ul><\/div><\/div><\/div>\n <div class=\"BVRRCustomUserInfoContainer\">\n<div class=\"BVRRContextDataContainer\"><div class=\"BVRRContextDataValueContainer BVRRContextDataValueFreeProductReceivedContainer BVContextDataFreeProductReceivedFalse\"><span class=\"BVRRLabel BVRRContextDataValuePrefix BVRRContextDataValueFreeProductReceivedPrefix\">Free product received:<\/span><span class=\"BVRRValue BVRRContextDataValue BVRRContextDataValueFreeProductReceived\">No<\/span><span class=\"BVRRLabel BVRRContextDataValueSuffix BVRRContextDataValueFreeProductReceivedSuffix\"><\/span><\/div><\/div> <\/div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"BVRRReviewDisplayStyle3Main\">\n <div class=\"BVRRReviewDisplayStyle3MainSpacer BVRRReviewDisplayStyle3MainSpacerTop\"><\/div>\n\n<div class=\"BVRRReviewRatingsContainer\"> <div class=\"BVRROverallRatingContainer\" >\n<div class=\"BVRRRatingContainerStar\"><div class=\"BVRRRatingEntry BVRROdd\"><div id=\"BVRRRatingOverall_Review_Display\" class=\"BVRRRating BVRRRatingNormal BVRRRatingOverall\"><div class=\"BVRRLabel BVRRRatingNormalLabel\"><\/div><div class=\"BVRRRatingNormalImage\">\n<div class=\"BVImgOrSprite\" style=\"width:75px;height:15px;overflow:hidden\"><img src=\"https://walmart.ugc.bazaarvoice.com/1336/5_0/9/rating.png\" alt=\"4 out of 5\" title=\"4 out of 5\" width=\"135\" height=\"15\" style=\"margin-left:-15px\" />\n<\/div><\/div>\n<div itemprop=\"reviewRating\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/Rating\" class=\"BVRRRatingNormalOutOf\"> <span itemprop=\"ratingValue\" class=\"BVRRNumber BVRRRatingNumber\">4<\/span>\n <span class=\"BVRRSeparatorText\">out of<\/span>\n <span itemprop=\"bestRating\" class=\"BVRRNumber BVRRRatingRangeNumber\">5<\/span>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div> <\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"BVRRReviewTitleContainer\"><span class=\"BVRRLabel BVRRReviewTitlePrefix\"><\/span><span itemprop=\"name\" class=\"BVRRValue BVRRReviewTitle\">more impressive than expected<\/span><span class=\"BVRRLabel BVRRReviewTitleSuffix\">, <\/span><\/div>\n<div class=\"BVRRReviewDateContainer\"><span class=\"BVRRLabel BVRRReviewDatePrefix\"><\/span><span class=\"BVRRValue BVRRReviewDate\">07/24/2026<meta itemprop=\"datePublished\" content=\"2026-07-24\"/><\/span><span class=\"BVRRLabel BVRRReviewDateSuffix\"><\/span><\/div>\n<div class=\"BVRRReviewDisplayStyle3Content\">\n <div itemprop=\"description\" class=\"BVRRReviewTextContainer\" >\n\n\n\n\n<div id=\"BVRRReviewAbbreviatedText433829291_e3my7xx5mx9oa6qskqw6tbf4o_ID\" class=\"BVRRReviewAbbreviatedText\"><div class=\"BVRRReviewAbbreviatedTextParagraph BVRRReviewAbbreviatedTextFirstParagraph BVRRReviewAbbreviatedTextLastParagraph\"> <span class=\"BVRRReviewAbbreviatedText\">ok,for me I've only used 20-24v weed trimmers.those did seem to last long time and seemed powerful but once you get this thing out and using it,you can definitely tell it's twice the power.id been looking for a deal on a 40v but though there's many<\/span>\n<span class=\"BVRRReviewAbbreviatedTextSuffix\"><span class=\"BVDI_AbbreviatedLinkPrefix\">...<\/span><span class=\"BVDI_AbbreviatedLink\"><a onclick=\" if(window.BVAnalyticsTracker){BVAnalyticsTracker.fireActionEvent(this);};&#10;$bv('#BVRRReviewAbbreviatedText433829291_e3my7xx5mx9oa6qskqw6tbf4o_ID').toggleClass('BVDIHidden');$bv('#BVRRReview433829291_5zxyw4zxwy37r8m8fycw89cx7_ID').toggleClass('BVDIHidden');bvStopPropagation(event);return false;\" name=\"BV_TrackingTag_Review_Display_ToggleReadMore\" href=\"#\" class=\"BVDILink \"><span class=\"BVDILinkSpan\">(read full review)<\/span><\/a><\/span><span class=\"BVDI_AbbreviatedLinkSuffix\"><\/span><\/span><\/div><\/div>\n<div id=\"BVRRReview433829291_5zxyw4zxwy37r8m8fycw89cx7_ID\" class=\"BVRRReviewText BVDIHidden\"><div class=\"BVRRReviewTextParagraph BVRRReviewTextFirstParagraph BVRRReviewTextLastParagraph\"> <span class=\"BVRRReviewText\">ok,for me I've only used 20-24v weed trimmers.those did seem to last long time and seemed powerful but once you get this thing out and using it,you can definitely tell it's twice the power.id been looking for a deal on a 40v but though there's many on sale,if u don't really read the specs.i found most weren't long enough for me being 6ft. a 40-44inch weed trimmer is back breaking, so when I saw this on sale with a leaf blower and it extended to 54in(don't quote me but it does extends)they had my attention.ive used both items and though the weed trimmer was exactly as if hope the leaf blower could use jus a lil more ummph,but I'm not sayn it doesn't do the jobs I needed it for,it did..it jus felt like it could use a lil more power but with that being said and at the price point I got these tools..I'm a happy camper and if I could change 1 thing is getting a 40v 4ah battery...the 40v 2ah though has the power jus isn't a marathon battery but a sprinter..so if u have light to high medium duty work and like something that feels good and easy to put together..don't hesitate on this combo..it was shipped in the actual box which had everything packaged nicely and secure....make yard work less like work<\/span>\n<span class=\"BVRRReviewTextSuffix\"><span class=\"BVDI_FullLinkPrefix\"><\/span><span class=\"BVDI_FullLink\"><a onclick=\" if(window.BVAnalyticsTracker){BVAnalyticsTracker.fireActionEvent(this);};&#10;$bv('#BVRRReviewAbbreviatedText433829291_e3my7xx5mx9oa6qskqw6tbf4o_ID').toggleClass('BVDIHidden');$bv('#BVRRReview433829291_5zxyw4zxwy37r8m8fycw89cx7_ID').toggleClass('BVDIHidden');bvStopPropagation(event);return false;\" name=\"BV_TrackingTag_Review_Display_ToggleReadMore\" href=\"#\" class=\"BVDILink \"><span class=\"BVDILinkSpan\">(hide full review)<\/span><\/a><\/span><span class=\"BVDI_FullLinkSuffix\"><\/span><\/span><\/div><\/div> <\/div>\n\n\n\n\n\n<\/div>\n\n <div class=\"RRBeforeFeedbackContainerSpacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n<div class=\"BVDI_FV\"><div class=\"BVDI_FVVoting BVDI_FVVotingHelpfulness\"><div class=\"BVDI_FVSum BVDI_FVSumHelpfulness\"><span class=\"BVDI_FVZero BVDI_FVLevel1\"><span class=\"BVDIValue BVDINumber\">0<\/span><span class=\"BVDISuffix\">points<\/span><\/span><\/div><div class=\"BVDI_FVCounts BVDI_FVCountsHelpfulness\"><\/div><div class=\"BVDI_FVVotes BVDI_FVVotesHelpfulness\"><span class=\"BVDIPrefix\">Was this helpful?<\/span><span class=\"BVDI_FVVote BVDI_FVPositive BVDI_FVLevel1\"><a data-bvjsref=\"https://walmart.ugc.bazaarvoice.com/submit/1336/3962878922/review/433829291/positive.djs?authsourcetype=__AUTHTYPE__&amp;format